 "note": "Virginia residents' drug overdose deaths (VDH 'All-Drug', CDC overdose-indicator definition) by locality (133 counties and independent cities). 2018-2022 from the by-FIPS file, which prints every count including 0-4; its 2023 column is marked preliminary and is not used. 2023-2024 from the current by-year-and-geography file, which prints 0 and counts of 5 and up and shows '*' for 1-4 (kept as a 1-4 band under 'masked'). The two files agree on every published locality-year 2019-2022 (totals 1,440, 2,100, 2,518, 2,396). 2025 (provisional) and 2026 (part year) are left out. Both files were saved by the owner from data.virginia.gov on 2026-10-15 (the portal answers scripted requests with 403). Licence: not specified (none_stated)."
